Manage and select Confluent Cloud IAM service accounts.

Usage:
  confluent iam service-account [command]

Aliases:
  service-account, sa

Available Commands:
  create      Create an IAM service account.
  delete      Delete one or more IAM service accounts.
  describe    Describe an IAM service account.
  list        List IAM service accounts.
  unset       Unset the current IAM service account.
  update      Update an existing IAM service account.
  use         Use an IAM service account in subsequent commands.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent iam service-account [command] --help" for more information about a command.
